    "description": "<p>Twice per session, you can designate a target as your <strong>Quarry</strong>—the focus of your hunt. Until the end of the session, you have a <strong>2d Quarry pool</strong> rolled as bonus dice to research or locate them, and when <em>anyone</em> attacks or defends against them. When a <strong>Quarry die</strong> rolls a '6', that PC <em><strong>takes spark</strong></em>.</p><p><strong>Prowler:</strong> You take +1d when using stealth, traversal, and traps in familiar terrain.</p><hr><p><strong>GROWTH:</strong> At levels 3 and 6, gain +1d to your Quarry pool.</p>",
